<title>USA: World Acceptance to buy Personal Credit.</title>
<headline>World Acceptance to buy Personal Credit.</headline>
<dateline>GREENVILLE, S.C. 1996-11-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>World Acceptance Corp said on Friday it has signed a letter of intent to buy all of the outstanding stock of Personal Credit Plan Inc, a San Antonio, Texas-based small-loan consumer finance company.</p>
<p>Financial terms were not disclosed.</p>
<p>The deal would add 36 new offices to the World branch network and about $11.5 million of small loan receivables to its portfolio, the company said.</p>
<p>The acquisition is subject to the completion and execution of a purchase agreement.</p>
</text>
